su name note ob text "Download channeling index and extract text for deterministic review." ya
from filename "https://www.llresearch.org/channeling" to filename "world/workplace/confederation/artifact/channeling.html" as wo web be download do
from filename "world/workplace/confederation/artifact/channeling.html" become wo markdown to name text channeling text be read do
ob name channeling text to filename "world/workplace/confederation/artifact/channeling.md" be write do
